# Shop profiles vs Supabase Auth (learned 2026-09-27)

**Invariant:** **Supabase Auth** is the registered-login source of truth. **Shop profiles & VIP** now **imports Auth VIP candidates** into local profiles and **lists only those emails** (seeds hidden). Summary metrics exclude company admins and known **test** customers.

