## Implementation

- `lib/authCustomerRoster.ts` — admin / test sets, `isAuthVipCustomerCandidate`, `countsTowardVipSummary`
- `userAuth.ensureShopProfilesFromAuth` — upsert missing local profiles by Auth email
- `/admin/users` + `/admin/users/grades` — fetch `/api/admin/supabase-users`, sync profiles, filter UI

Seeds (`user@example.com`, seed Administrator) stay in Zustand for demo login but are **not shown** on VIP.

## Do / Do not

**Do** — Treat Auth as register list; keep company admins out of VIP; keep EMMA out of summary until deleted from Auth.

**Do not** — Show Seed rows on VIP; count jimmy/info as customers; treat EMMA sales as production VIP proof.
